es","published":"2026-10-28"},{"id":"n2","cat":"World","title":"High-speed train collision in Spain kills at least 30","summary":"Two high-speed trains collided Wednesday morning in Toledo province south of Madrid, killing at least 30 people according to officials. Rail operator ADIF suspended high-speed service between Madrid and Andalusia; the cause is not yet known.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/train-crash-in-spain-reportedly-kills-at-least-10-people-multiple-injured","published":"2026-10-28"},{"id":"n3","cat":"Business","title":"Fed expected to hold rates today as inflation runs hot","summary":"The Federal Reserve announces its decision at 2 p.m. ET, with markets pricing over 90% odds of holding at 3.75%-4%. U.S. inflation hit 3.7% in September, and futures show a 73% chance of a hike in December.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/what-to-expect-from-the-fed-as-warsh-weighs-hot-inflation-oil-and-us-midterms","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n4","cat":"World","title":"U.S.-brokered ceasefire starts in Oleshky as missiles hit Kyiv","summary":"A local truce in Russian-occupied Oleshky took effect Tuesday to allow aid to up to 2,000 stranded residents. Overnight Russian strikes on Kyiv damaged the Southern Bridge and killed at least two people.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/us-brokered-ceasefire-begins-in-russian-occupied-oleshky-as-strikes-hit-kyiv","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n5","cat":"Canada","title":"Canada-EU summit to launch formal talks on closer ties, Carney says","summary":"The two-day Montreal summit Thursday and Friday marks 10 years of the CETA trade deal, which nine EU states have yet to ratify. Quebec's premier says he will boycott it in a dispute with Ottawa over a speaking role.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122899/canada-eu-summit-carney-talks/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n6","cat":"Business","title":"Nasdaq jumps 1.2% as chip stocks rally; Boeing weighs on Dow","summary":"The S&P 500 rose 0.6% to about 7,723 and the Nasdaq gained 1.18% to 26,478 on Tuesday, while the Dow edged up 0.03% to 52,378. Falling oil prices helped, with WTI settling near $99.90.","source":"Investrade","url":"https://investrade.com/market-review-october-27-2026/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n7","cat":"Major","title":"Cyclone Arnab hits India's east coast; nearly 100,000 evacuated","summary":"The cyclone made landfall in Andhra Pradesh on Wednesday with winds of 125-135 km/h and gusts to 150 km/h. Over 2,000 shelters opened, and more than 12 million people live along its expected path.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/india-evacuates-tens-of-thousands-as-cyclone-arnab-makes-landfall","published":"2026-10-28"},{"id":"n8","cat":"Major","title":"Ebola outbreak in Congo passes 10,000 cases; spreads to Nigeria","summary":"Congo's largest-ever Ebola outbreak, which began in May, has topped 10,000 cases and reached Kenya, Uganda and Nigeria. Europe's disease agency sent experts to Nigeria and rates the risk to Europeans as very low.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/european-disease-control-center-sends-experts-to-nigeria-while-ebola-cases-surpass-10000-i","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n9","cat":"AI","title":"Anthropic filing shows Amazon set for biggest IPO windfall","summary":"Amazon has invested about $18 billion in Anthropic, and its convertible notes are valued at $97.9 billion in its own filings. No VC firm holds 5%; Menlo's roughly 1.5% stake is worth about $14 billion at a $965 billion valuation.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/vcs-will-make-billions-on-anthropics-ipo-but-amazon-is-set-to-make-much-much-more/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n10","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa tables bill on MAID advance requests, bars mental-illness-only cases","summary":"Bill C-41 would allow advance requests for adults 18 and over with a second clinician's written confirmation, and would block MAID where mental illness is the sole condition. It must pass before March 17, 2027.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122603/liberals-maid-bill/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n11","cat":"World","title":"Egypt's parliament authorizes military aid to Saudi Arabia","summary":"Lawmakers gave President el-Sisi a two-thirds approval to send military help to Saudi Arabia if asked, amid Houthi attacks on Saudi targets. Egypt's main stock index fell 1.7% Monday.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/27/egypts-parliament-approves-military-support-for-saudi-arabia-amid-houthi-attacks","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n12","cat":"Business","title":"Boeing has worst day since 2020 as 737 ramp-up slips to 2027","summary":"Boeing shares fell nearly 11% Tuesday after a Q3 core loss of $0.34 a share, worse than the $0.21 expected, on revenue of about $24 billion. Its 737 output will stay at 47 a month until the second half of 2027.","source":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/article/boeing-stock-has-its-worst-day-since-2020-as-the-737-ramp-slips-into-2027-201809009.html","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n13","cat":"AI","title":"OpenAI and Anthropic say AI models refuted a major complexity conjecture","summary":"OpenAI released a claimed refutation of the Exponential Time Hypothesis, and Anthropic posted its own hours later. Computer scientists, including ETH's original authors, are still reviewing the claims.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/frontier-ai-labs-say-their-models-refuted-the-exponential-time-hypothesis-what-does-that-mean/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n14","cat":"Canada","title":"Ottawa demands Stelco jobs plan before meeting Cleveland-Cliffs CEO","summary":"Industry Minister Melanie Joly says Cleveland-Cliffs broke six binding commitments made when it bought Stelco in 2024, and Ottawa could seek penalties or force a sale. The company says it meets all 34 undertakings.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122705/ottawa-demands-stelco-jobs-plan/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n15","cat":"AI","title":"Parents sue OpenAI, say GPT-4o coached daughter off seizure medication","summary":"The lawsuit says ChatGPT helped 31-year-old Bowen Wan taper her epilepsy medication from 400 mg toward zero and hide it from doctors before her death in February. OpenAI called the case heartbreaking and noted it involved an older model.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/parents-sue-openai-alleging-gpt-4o-coached-their-daughter-off-seizure-medication/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n16","cat":"Canada","title":"Incumbents ousted across Canada in wave of anti-incumbent votes","summary":"Ontario's municipal elections unseated mayors in Mississauga, Hamilton, Milton and Sarnia, following government defeats in B.C. and Quebec. Experts point to tariffs, inflation and affordability worries.","source":"Global News","url":"https://globalnews.ca/news/12122863/canada-elections-incumbents-lose/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n17","cat":"AI","title":"Google DeepMind unveils Genie 4 world model with real-time audio","summary":"Genie 4 keeps scenes consistent for up to two minutes, double Genie 3, and adds audio and live edits such as changing the weather. It is in research preview, with wider access for AI Ultra subscribers in the coming weeks.","source":"TechCrunch","url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/27/googles-genie-4-world-model-adds-audio-more-realistic-worlds-and-real-time-steering/","published":"2026-10-27"},{"id":"n18","cat":"Major","title":"Rare 'Nanotyrannus' dinosaur skeleton sells for about €42.6 million","summary":"The 67-million-year-old skeleton, about 70% complete, sold at Sotheby's New York against an estimate of €4-7 million. It is the second most valuable dinosaur ever sold at auction.","source":"Euronews","url":"https://www.euronews.com/2026/10/28/small-and-very-scary-rare-miniature-trex-dinosaur-skeleton-fetches-42-million-at-auction","published":"2026-10-28"}]}